      "source": "An <a href=\"OrderByNullPrecedence.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.dialect\"><code>OrderByNullPrecedence</code></a> implementation for databases conforming to the SQL standard which uses\n<code>NULLS FIRST</code> and <code>NULLS LAST</code> in <code>ORDER BY</code> sort expressions to make null values appear before\nor after non-null values in the result set.",
      "translation": "针对符合 SQL 标准的数据库，提供一个<a href=\"OrderByNullPrecedence.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.dialect\"><code>OrderByNullPrecedence</code></a>实现，该实现在<code>ORDER BY</code>排序表达式中使用<code>NULLS FIRST</code>和<code>NULLS LAST</code>，以使空值在结果集中出现在非空值之前或之后。",
